WEBVTT

01:29.300 --> 01:33.610
Can't believe I've got night duty on
the eve of the Advent Festival.

01:33.610 --> 01:35.410
We do Christmas at our house.

01:35.410 --> 01:39.640
I hope I can at least get home by
the time my kid wakes up.

01:39.980 --> 01:42.310
How old is he?

01:42.310 --> 01:43.940
He just turned...

01:45.950 --> 01:47.580
The military?!

01:49.990 --> 01:51.850
What's going on?

01:56.600 --> 01:58.220
Wh-Whoa! Wait a...

02:12.880 --> 02:17.840
Twelfth Night


02:12.880 --> 02:17.840
Bloody Eve

02:56.520 --> 02:57.690
Yoshio?!

02:57.690 --> 02:59.690
Hang in there, Yoshio!

02:59.690 --> 03:01.320
Yoshio!

03:05.330 --> 03:06.960
Yoshio...

03:07.730 --> 03:11.220
So, I've led you to it too.

03:12.070 --> 03:18.030
I meant for it to end with me.
Forgive me.

03:18.380 --> 03:20.450
Stay with me, Yoshio!

03:20.450 --> 03:24.010
You're too tough to die from a
little wound like this! Right?

03:24.750 --> 03:29.120
I took too many lives with these hands

03:29.990 --> 03:34.790
to die any kind of decent death.

03:38.360 --> 03:40.500
No! Don't go, Yoshio!

03:40.500 --> 03:47.730
Don't forget, now you'll know everything.

03:50.910 --> 03:52.680
Yoshio!

03:52.680 --> 03:55.440
YOSHIO!

04:40.060 --> 04:42.250
What a crazy party.

04:43.090 --> 04:46.660
So, this is how they celebrate
a holy night in this country.

04:51.940 --> 04:55.500
Don't feel bad, they didn't die in vain.

04:56.570 --> 05:03.740
Our jesters proved by their deaths how much
power is needed to capture our target.

05:05.020 --> 05:08.470
You used my creations as pawns?!

05:09.020 --> 05:12.480
Perhaps it's time we headed out.

05:15.160 --> 05:17.530
For the Black Phantom!

05:22.700 --> 05:25.190
For the Black Phantom...

06:02.010 --> 06:03.630
Mikogami!

06:04.080 --> 06:06.640
Damn it! Don't you dare croak on me!

06:07.780 --> 06:10.120
I'm not done with you yet!

06:10.120 --> 06:11.120
Kiriko!

06:11.120 --> 06:11.320
Kiriko!
Kiriko!

06:11.320 --> 06:12.310
Kiriko!

06:12.650 --> 06:13.690
Kiriko!

06:13.690 --> 06:17.090
Wake up, Kiriko! Open your eyes!

06:17.090 --> 06:18.720
Don't die!

06:20.760 --> 06:22.850
Hey! Come on, now!

06:27.130 --> 06:29.600
Now what?!

06:35.310 --> 06:37.240
On the bus, everyone!

06:37.240 --> 06:38.840
But what about the Father?

06:38.840 --> 06:40.980
We won't go without him!

06:40.980 --> 06:43.350
And the man with the hat!

06:43.980 --> 06:45.810
Damn it...

06:48.150 --> 06:49.780
Here...

06:50.560 --> 06:52.180
How's that?

06:52.960 --> 06:56.790
I'm sure Father Kanzaki will be
along shortly. Now, hurry!

07:03.470 --> 07:07.070
Must be a rebel faction of the military,

07:07.070 --> 07:09.340
friends of your son.

07:17.920 --> 07:19.850
Ch-Chairman?

07:19.850 --> 07:22.290
This is terrible!

07:22.290 --> 07:24.990
It's an uprising! A military insurrection!

07:24.990 --> 07:28.230
They've already assumed control
of the heart of the city,

07:28.230 --> 07:30.930
including the central station
and government buildings!

07:30.930 --> 07:34.370
They've surrounded the police station too,

07:34.370 --> 07:38.070
but all of our officers are united in its defense!

07:38.070 --> 07:44.470
Gisuke Haniwa will defend your precious city,
Chairman, if it means my life!

07:48.910 --> 07:51.450
Please, your orders, Sir!

07:51.450 --> 07:53.820
It's up to you.

07:54.890 --> 07:56.510
Chairman!

07:56.690 --> 07:58.420
Mr. Haniwa?

07:59.420 --> 08:01.050
You know him?

08:02.030 --> 08:05.590
My work here is done.

08:05.960 --> 08:09.460
I'd best be going before we get
caught in the crossfire.

08:09.600 --> 08:11.200
Recently,

08:11.200 --> 08:16.160
there was a report that secret service agent
was stationed in this town.

08:17.780 --> 08:19.640
It was you, wasn't it?

08:20.850 --> 08:22.950
Hard to say.

08:22.950 --> 08:25.580
But there's one thing I can tell you.

08:26.350 --> 08:29.120
Your business isn't finished yet.

08:29.120 --> 08:31.710
And neither is mine.

08:41.000 --> 08:45.990
This just in from Kodama.
The strike team has located the target.

08:46.170 --> 08:50.740
Good! The forbidden thunder is within grasp!

08:50.740 --> 08:52.240
Head for the White Bell!

08:52.240 --> 08:53.870
Yes, Sir!

08:56.880 --> 08:58.510
Major!

08:58.750 --> 09:00.420
This just in from Sakura.

09:00.420 --> 09:03.250
In the target area, the uh...

09:03.250 --> 09:04.360
What?

09:04.360 --> 09:06.060
The Phantom...

09:06.060 --> 09:08.360
The Masked Man has appeared.

09:09.560 --> 09:13.890
Never mind him. Our priority
is securing our target!

09:16.370 --> 09:18.700
Why, Yoshio?

09:19.740 --> 09:22.710
Why did you have to kill the woman you love?

09:23.940 --> 09:26.140
What am I doing?

09:26.310 --> 09:28.280
Where am I going?

09:28.610 --> 09:32.280
Why must I carry out what
Yoshio left undone?

09:34.420 --> 09:36.850
Because I believed you would liberate me.

09:36.850 --> 09:38.090
Maya!

09:38.090 --> 09:40.960
That you were the one.

09:51.300 --> 09:53.790
What can I do for you?

09:54.510 --> 10:00.180
I don't know. I don't understand myself.

10:00.180 --> 10:03.350
I'm afraid I can't help you.

10:03.350 --> 10:08.220
I, too, am trapped in a prison of Oblivion.

10:09.750 --> 10:12.450
I believed you would free me!

10:12.990 --> 10:18.660
I'm trapped in a prison, a prison of the Heart.

10:18.660 --> 10:20.800
But I thought that you...

10:20.800 --> 10:22.790
...that you could save me, Father!

10:25.000 --> 10:29.040
I have no power now.

10:29.040 --> 10:30.800
But I saw you!

10:32.710 --> 10:37.280
I saw this church in a dream, and I saw you!

10:37.280 --> 10:39.040
And I sensed it.

10:40.150 --> 10:43.550
I was led to this place!

10:47.160 --> 10:49.220
To your soul!

11:33.640 --> 11:35.370
Hey, stop!

11:35.970 --> 11:38.380
Please, let us through!

11:38.380 --> 11:40.940
This road is closed. Go back!

11:41.210 --> 11:46.050
We've received a holy message!
Our faith is being tested!

11:47.490 --> 11:49.350
Sergeant, who are these people?

11:49.350 --> 11:50.990
Members of that cult.

11:50.990 --> 11:55.590
I beg you, please!
Please, let us through!

11:55.590 --> 11:58.530
Let go! Let go of me!

12:14.410 --> 12:16.680
Fire! Fire!

12:32.800 --> 12:34.000
Holy...

12:34.000 --> 12:38.000
Good grief, this town is a nest of demons!

12:38.000 --> 12:39.170
Don't let your guard down!

12:39.170 --> 12:41.370
These aren't the only monsters!

12:41.370 --> 12:43.000
Yes, Sir!

12:57.120 --> 13:00.250
What is this? What the hell's going on?

13:05.660 --> 13:07.790
Damn it! Hold on!

13:26.220 --> 13:29.850
Once again, you're abandoning your men
to save your own hide?

13:30.150 --> 13:31.780
Who's there!?

13:32.560 --> 13:37.120
You haven't changed a bit,
MP Captain Haniwa!

13:37.930 --> 13:39.830
Who the hell are you?!

13:39.830 --> 13:43.230
Dear, me! Don't tell me you've
forgotten this face?

13:44.840 --> 13:46.630
Lieutenant Samonji?

13:46.800 --> 13:48.610
Bull's-eye!

13:48.610 --> 13:53.410
The one you branded a traitor and
sent to the front lines!

13:53.950 --> 13:56.640
Kyoichiro Samonji!

13:57.920 --> 13:59.580
You're alive?!

13:59.580 --> 14:05.790
It was quite a surprise when I came to this
town for work and found out you were here.

14:05.790 --> 14:09.420
A big shot Chief of Police, no less!

14:10.190 --> 14:13.100
After all those heinous deeds in the military...

14:13.100 --> 14:17.200
Selling stolen arms, looting on the battlefield...

14:17.200 --> 14:23.040
You know very well it was a different time!
Everyone was doing it!

14:23.040 --> 14:27.880
Ha! When I confronted you about the
atrocities you were committing,

14:27.880 --> 14:30.450
you sent me to the front lines!

14:30.450 --> 14:32.080
And that wasn't all.

14:32.080 --> 14:34.890
You sent my wife and child to prison too!

14:34.890 --> 14:38.320
Poor things, they died there.

14:38.320 --> 14:42.050
My wife, and my son who was barely four!

14:42.190 --> 14:46.630
W-Wait, Samonji! You've got it all wrong!

14:46.630 --> 14:48.200
What?!

14:48.200 --> 14:50.800
Don't tell me you still mean
to beg for your life?!

14:50.800 --> 14:52.600
Go see your kid in Hell!

15:09.520 --> 15:14.050
You can't bribe the guards
at the gates of Hell, pal.

15:15.890 --> 15:17.500
Now...

15:17.500 --> 15:20.430
...all that's left is to see the end of this city.

15:28.810 --> 15:31.900
What a beautiful bride!

15:33.110 --> 15:35.640
You look lovely, Miss Maya.

15:35.910 --> 15:39.410
Like a true divine leader of Humanity!

15:39.980 --> 15:48.160
How I've toiled to see you like this,
to stand here at this moment.

15:48.160 --> 15:51.790
It's unseemly to jibber-jabber
at the moment of death.

15:53.160 --> 15:57.930
I never had any interest
in your otherworldly ideals.

15:58.400 --> 16:00.560
What?!

16:00.770 --> 16:03.600
My goal was but one...

16:05.240 --> 16:06.940
To steal!

16:08.510 --> 16:12.080
Bite your tongue! What nonsense is this?!

16:12.080 --> 16:16.120
The potential for omnipotence
Tatsuyuki Kagura detected...

16:16.120 --> 16:19.460
The vast powers Gozo Kuroshio nurtured...

16:19.460 --> 16:21.480
...will soon be mine!

16:22.760 --> 16:28.200
Y-You monster! Ingrate!
After all we've done for you!

16:32.600 --> 16:37.130
As his proper wife, I don't suppose you ever
even deigned to think about it.

16:38.080 --> 16:41.200
The day my mother died, I made up my mind!

17:04.900 --> 17:08.860
Despair and sadness are the
ultimate offerings.

17:12.280 --> 17:16.110
Now, let the wedding begin!

17:23.050 --> 17:26.150
Damn it, damn it, damn it!

17:32.730 --> 17:35.430
Yamagi! You're alive!

17:35.430 --> 17:38.700
Oh, I'd never go down that easily!

17:40.200 --> 17:42.370
Here, you forgot something.

17:45.480 --> 17:47.140
Don't take it so hard.

17:47.140 --> 17:49.640
You'll be able to give it to her soon.

17:50.310 --> 17:51.780
In the next world.

17:51.780 --> 17:53.050
What?!

17:53.050 --> 18:00.220
Sorry, Shinjo, now that you've learned this
town's secret, I can't let you leave it alive.

18:02.660 --> 18:04.490
Ya-Yamagi...

18:05.500 --> 18:08.530
I should tell you one thing.

18:08.530 --> 18:13.630
She, Nami Kisaragi, was one of us too!

18:14.940 --> 18:18.040
I told you, didn't I? Women are demons!

18:18.040 --> 18:19.670
But...

18:23.610 --> 18:25.420
Hurry up and escape!

18:25.420 --> 18:28.410
Sister?! You survived!

18:30.250 --> 18:32.860
I've been ordered to protect you.

18:32.860 --> 18:34.480
What?

18:40.300 --> 18:42.200
You too?!

18:48.510 --> 18:51.080
Hayato...Hayato...

18:51.080 --> 18:52.700
Hayato!

19:53.640 --> 19:57.970
She is the Earth that gives birth
to a chain of sadness.

20:04.180 --> 20:07.810
It was she who salvaged my faith,

20:08.090 --> 20:11.950
and for her I turn my back on it.

20:14.290 --> 20:16.520
All that awaits now,

20:16.630 --> 20:19.990
is a cursed destiny and tears of blood.

20:24.440 --> 20:30.030
Even so, I cannot waver from my path.

20:35.350 --> 20:37.140
For my beloved...

20:39.120 --> 20:41.280
For Maya...

20:52.230 --> 20:54.490
I've been waiting for you,

20:54.900 --> 20:57.530
Masked Phantom!

21:03.070 --> 21:07.750
Tatta hitotsu no sora shika nai yo

21:07.750 --> 21:12.180
Donna ni sekai ga hirokutatte

21:12.320 --> 21:16.850
Daiji na hito to hagureta toki

21:16.850 --> 21:22.450
Miageru mono ga yuukizukeru

21:22.590 --> 21:27.230
Kyou made aruite kita michi

21:27.230 --> 21:31.740
lma wa futatsu ni wakareteru

21:31.740 --> 21:40.580
Namida wa mata au hi no kokoro no shirushi

21:40.840 --> 21:45.420
Ashita wa ashita no kimi ga umareru yo

21:45.420 --> 21:50.590
Nagai yoru wo koe hi ga noboru you ni

21:50.590 --> 21:54.590
Yume no tsuzuki subete sutete

21:54.590 --> 21:58.860
Ryoute wo hirogeyou

21:59.100 --> 22:03.730
Mirai wa itsudemo kimi no me no mae de

22:03.730 --> 22:08.740
Fumidasu sono toki wo zutto matteiru

22:08.740 --> 22:12.840
Chiheisen no mukou gawa ni

22:12.840 --> 22:20.650
Mada minu sekai tsugi no deai

22:24.990 --> 22:25.120
Thirteenth Night


22:24.990 --> 22:25.120
Black Fable

22:25.120 --> 22:29.860
Thirteenth Night


22:25.120 --> 22:29.860
Black Fable

22:25.120 --> 22:29.860

Oh, Lord, art Thou here?

22:29.860 --> 22:33.760
Thirteenth Night


22:29.860 --> 22:33.760
Black Fable

22:29.860 --> 22:33.760

My body is branded with tears.

22:33.760 --> 22:37.400
Thirteenth Night


22:33.760 --> 22:37.400
Black Fable

22:33.760 --> 22:37.400

The hour of judgement is at hand.

22:37.400 --> 22:38.270
Thirteenth Night


22:37.400 --> 22:38.270
Black Fable
